   "widgets_values": [
    "## load3d-texture-probe.json\n\nDoes the ComfyUI 3D viewer render GLB textures yet?\n\n**Does:** loads `input/3d/E6_textured_AB.glb` (a copy of a Hy3D textured export) in a single `Load3D` node - the *modern* viewer, so this tests the viewer, not a pipeline.\n**Expected on frontend 1.52.6:** the mesh appears **untextured** even with material mode `original` - a frontend limitation; the GLB itself is fine (Blender and Windows 3D Viewer show colour).\n**If it shows colour:** the limitation is fixed, and `Preview3D`/`Preview3DAdvanced` become usable for texture checks again (the nvdiffrast still can stay as a cheap second opinion).\n**Before running:** put any textured GLB in `ComfyUI/input/3d/` and pick it in the node.\n**See:** `../../comfyui/README.md` (3D preview gotcha), `../EXPERIMENTS.md` E6/E7.\n"
   ]
  },
